   "title": "Downloads + requirements",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Downloads + requirements\n\nClick the file name to download it. Put it in the folder shown (inside `ComfyUI/models/`).\n\n| Folder | File (click = download) | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `checkpoints/` | [sd_xl_base_1.0.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0/resolve/main/sd_xl_base_1.0.safetensors) | 6.94 GB |\n\nOne file. The text encoders and the VAE are inside the checkpoint.\n\n**VRAM:** one picture at megapixels 1 peaked at 7.6 to 10.0 GiB for the whole GPU (nvidia-smi, read once per second; about 0.45 GiB of it was held by other programs). `batch_size` 2: 12.5 GiB. Megapixels 2: 12.9 GiB. The card has 24 GB and ComfyUI uses the room it finds, so these numbers do not show what a 12 GB card needs. **Not verified on 12 GB.**\n\n**Run on ComfyUI 0.45.3** (the Size node needs a recent ComfyUI; older versions were not tested). **No custom nodes.**\n\nLicence: SDXL base 1.0 is under the CreativeML Open RAIL++-M License. Read the model page.\n"
   ]
  }
 ],
